OUTPUT PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift — covenant #9)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt names the output dir `apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/**`.
That path does NOT exist in this repo and is NOT a project.yml source group. The repo's
real, compiled canonical page home is `apps/apple/Sources/Features/<Domain>/` (the landed
sibling p4-apple P7 battery pages BatteryCells + BatteryDegradation live there; `Sources`
is a project.yml source path with createIntermediateGroups, so new files are auto-compiled).
The page therefore ships at `apps/apple/Sources/Features/Battery/**` — the faithful
equivalent of the prompt's `Features/Battery`. Strings ship in the platform catalog
`apps/apple/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings` (an allowed file); navigation registration
lives in `Sources/App/AppRoute.swift` + `Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift`; the model test in
`Tests/Unit/Features/Battery/`. This mapping is identical to the reconciliation the landed
sibling battery pages recorded; it is the only deviation from the literal prompt path.

SI NOTE (ADR-005 / frontend-si-cutover parity): the model stores phantom-loss energy in
watt-hours and every duration in seconds (SI). The display boundary renders energy as kWh
and durations as hours, faithfully reproducing the web presentation (`${v} kWh`, `${v}h`).
Percentages, the %/hr drain rate, and the 0–100 drain score are unit-preference-independent
and format directly.

