DISPOSITION
================================================================================
A complete, HIG-native SwiftUI VampireDrainPage shipped at parity with the web source: a pure
@Observable state holder (ADR-004 — no networking in the view) exposing loading/empty/error/
success over an injectable VampireDrainDataSource seam (default = an 8-session SI sample); an
adaptive layout (macOS/iPad regular vs iPhone compact) using the P2 tokens + P3 shared
components — TSGlassPanel/TSCard/TSMetricCard-shape/TSEmptyState/TSErrorDisplay/TSDataTable/
TSBadge/TSRadialGauge/TSLineChart/TSBarChart/typography — with the four summary metric tiles,
the drain-score gauge, the drain-rate-trend line chart, the dual-series daily-drain bar chart,
the sortable seven-column drain-sessions table with a session-count badge, and the green
tips panel. Every visible string resolves from Localizable.xcstrings with web key names; full
VoiceOver labels/traits on panels + charts. SI watt-hours/seconds convert to kWh/hours at the
render boundary. Deep-linkable via the new .vampireDrain route (AppRouteParser resolves
/vampire-drain automatically) and hosted through the shell's route registry. Verified by
